{
  "statement": "I appreciate the collaborative efforts to enhance user consent and notifications. I support dropping RES-01 due to redundancy with SAF-01 and EFF-04. I also agree with the modifications proposed for RES-05 and RES-06 to ensure user consent and prior notifications. However, I propose modifying GRN-01 to allow for energy-efficient processing during peak loads, ensuring that performance requirements do not compromise sustainability. Additionally, I suggest integrating GRN-02's carbon footprint reporting with transaction logs to avoid redundancy with SAF-04, promoting transparency without duplicating efforts.",
